            "value": "Name"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nimmt Systemton und Mikrofon getrennt auf.": {
      "comment": "Help text of the online record item.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Records system audio and the microphone as separate channels."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nimmt das Raummikrofon auf. Teilnehmer informieren.": {
      "comment": "Help text of the on-site record item.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Records the room microphone. Tell the other participants."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nimmt deine Stimme auf. Beide Modi brauchen es.": {
      "comment": "One-sentence explanation of the microphone permission.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Records your voice. Both modes need it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nimmt den Ton der Meeting-App auf, damit die anderen Teilnehmer im Transkript stehen. Nur für Online-Meetings.": {
      "comment": "One-sentence explanation of the system audio permission.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Records the meeting app’s audio so the other participants end up in the transcript. Online meetings only."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Noch kein Meeting aufgenommen.": {
      "comment": "Help text when there is no last meeting to show.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No meeting recorded yet."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nur der Titel, nur während einer Aufnahme, nur um den Ordner zu benennen und Regeln zu prüfen. Zoom und Google Meet tragen im Fenstertitel keinen Meetingnamen — das ist der einzige Weg dorthin. Standardmäßig aus.": {
      "comment": "Privacy sentence for the calendar-titles setting.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only the title, only during a recording, only to name the folder and match rules. Zoom and Google Meet carry no meeting name in their window titles — this is the only way to one. Off by default."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nur noch %@ frei. Eine Stunde Aufnahme braucht rund 1 GB.": {
      "comment": "Low disk space warning; %@ is a formatted byte count.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only %@ left. An hour of recording needs about 1 GB."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nutzt eine dieser Apps das Mikrofon, schlägt Steno eine Aufnahme vor. Erkannt wird ausschließlich über Core Audio — kein Kalender, keine Fensterinspektion.": {
      "comment": "Explains the watchlist.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When one of these apps reads the microphone, Steno offers to record. Detection is Core Audio only — no calendar, no window scraping."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Onboarding erneut anzeigen": {
      "comment": "Button that reopens the onboarding window.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show onboarding again"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Online": {
      "comment": "Mode name, as it appears in the recording status line.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Online"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Online-Meeting aufnehmen": {
      "comment": "Menu item.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Record online meeting"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ordner": {
      "comment": "Settings label showing the model directory path.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
