      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open folder"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ordner, in dem Steno die Meetings ablegt.": {
      "comment": "Message of the folder picker.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The folder Steno writes meetings into."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Regel aktiv": {
      "comment": "Help text of the enable toggle in a rule.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rule active"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Regel entfernen": {
      "comment": "Help text of the remove button in a rule.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remove rule"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Regel hinzufügen": {
      "comment": "Button that appends a new rule.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add rule"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Regeln": {
      "comment": "Settings tab, and the name of the rules pane inside it.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rules"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Regeln werden geprüft, sobald ein Meeting erkannt wird. Die erste passende gewinnt; passt keine, fragt Steno nach.": {
      "comment": "Explains the rules table.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rules are evaluated as soon as a meeting is detected. The first match wins; if none matches, Steno asks."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Regex": {
      "comment": "Toggle in a rule row.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Regex"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Screenshots": {
      "comment": "Settings tab.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Screenshots"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "So lange darf keine beobachtete App mehr das Mikrofon lesen, bevor eine Online-Aufnahme sich selbst beendet.": {
      "comment": "Explains the auto-stop delay.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This long without a watched app reading the microphone before an online recording stops itself."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "So oft wird jedes Display gesichert, egal ob sich etwas geändert hat. Ohne das hätte ein statischer Monitor über eine Stunde kein einziges Bild.": {
      "comment": "Explains the anchor interval.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "How often each display is saved regardless of what changed. Without it a static monitor would go a whole hour without a single frame."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Speichert Screenshots der Bildschirme und liest Fenstertitel für Regeln.": {
      "comment": "One-sentence explanation of the screen recording permission.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saves screenshots of the displays and reads window titles for rules."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spracherkennung und Sprechertrennung laufen offline auf diesem Mac. Die Modelle werden einmal geladen.": {
      "comment": "One-sentence explanation of the models row.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speech recognition and speaker separation run offline on this Mac. The models are downloaded once."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Spracherkennung und Sprechertrennung laufen offline. Der Download ist die einzige Netzverbindung, die Steno je aufbaut.": {
      "comment": "Explains the transcription settings.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Speech recognition and speaker separation run offline. The download is the only network connection Steno ever makes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sprachisolierung": {
      "comment": "Microphone mode name, as Control Centre calls it.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voice Isolation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sprachisolierung dämpft die anderen Teilnehmer.": {
      "comment": "Reason an on-site recording is refused: macOS Voice Isolation is active.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voice Isolation damps the other participants."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sprachisolierung dämpft die anderen Teilnehmer. Für eine Raumaufnahme braucht Steno den Mikrofonmodus „Breites Spektrum“ oder „Standard“.": {
      "comment": "Body of the alert shown when Voice Isolation blocks an on-site recording.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voice Isolation damps the other participants. A room recording needs the microphone mode “Wide Spectrum” or “Standard”."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sprecherzahl vor einer Vor-Ort-Aufnahme abfragen": {
      "comment": "Settings toggle.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Ask how many speakers before an on-site recording"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Standard": {
      "comment": "Microphone mode name, as Control Centre calls it.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Standard"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steno einrichten": {
      "comment": "Title of the onboarding window.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Set up Steno"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steno nimmt Meetings auf und transkribiert sie auf diesem Mac. Dafür braucht es drei Berechtigungen und einmal die Modelle.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding subtitle.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steno records meetings and transcribes them on this Mac. For that it needs three permissions and, once, the models."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steno schreibt ausschließlich in den Ordner, den du unter „Einstellungen → Allgemein“ auswählst. Ausnahme: die Modelle liegen unter „Library/Application Support/Steno“. Nichts verlässt diesen Mac.": {
      "comment": "Onboarding footer.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steno writes only into the folder you choose under Settings → General. The one exception is the models, which live in Library/Application Support/Steno. Nothing leaves this Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Steno-Einstellungen": {
      "comment": "Title of the settings window.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Steno Settings"
          }
        }
      }
